	(descr "Amiga Zorro II 100-pin card edge, 2.54 mm pitch, 2x50 gold fingers. Even pins on F.Cu, odd on B.Cu; pins 1/2 at +X end. Pad geometry follows MNT VA2000 zorro2card footprint (MIT). Origin = card edge. Finger length, bevel and orientation relative to the A2000 bracket: TBV (Stage 6).")
